<title>USA: Personnel Management buys Kentucky firm.</title>
<headline>Personnel Management buys Kentucky firm.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWOOD, Ind. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personnel Management Inc said Wednesday it expanded its Kentucky operations through the purchase of a new branch office. It acquired the assets of First In Temporaries Inc in Louisville, Ky.</p>
<p>Terms of the cash transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquired business had 1996 annualized revenues of $1.7 million.</p>
<p>In addition, Personnel Management said it recently opened a new recruiting office in Louisville.</p>
<p>The company provides staffing services to businesses through 37 offices in Indiana, Kentucky, Florida and Georgia.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
